# Mesa patch series for GFX1013 (BC-250), applied in order against
# pristine mesa-26.2.0-rc3 with `git apply` / `patch -p1`.
#
# Patches 0001-0004 updated from MastaG/linux-cachyos-bc250 (Aug 2026).
# 0005 replaced with V3 deferred SDot hybrid from dmorazasanchez/bc250-fsr4.
#
# 0001: Expose ACE compute queue + async compute threadgroup workaround.
# 0002: Mesh/task shading on GFX1013 via GFX10.3 software path.
# 0003: Mesh/task pipeline-statistics queries (requires 0002).
# 0004: Opt-in RADV_GFX103=1 env var to promote GFX1013 to GFX10.3.
#       Safe by itself — only activates when user sets the env var.
#       Do not export globally; enable per-game only.
# 0005: FSR4 V3 deferred SDot hybrid — iadd(0,SDot) fusion, MAD24 chains,
#       dense SDot pre-pass. Supersedes V2 selective sdot. Always active.
#       (stripped: ac_gpu_info.c and radv_physical_device.c changes are
#       already in 0001 and 0004 respectively)
#
# Alternative: patches/mesa-native-mesh/series uses lonewolf0622's native
# mesh approach (MESH only, no TASK, no GFX10.3 spoof needed).
